<view class="page"><view class="safe-top"/><view class="detail-top"><button class="back" bindtap="back">‹</button><view class="detail-title">我的计划</view></view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在打开你的安排…</view><block wx:else wx:if="{{plan}}"><view class="hero-panel"><text class="route-tag">{{statusLabel}}</text><view class="hero-title">{{plan.route_snapshot.title}}</view><view class="hero-copy">{{plan.route_snapshot.description}}</view><view class="facts">{{scheduledAt||'还没定下时间，也没关系。'}}</view></view><view class="form-card"><view class="form-title">给这次出发留个时间</view><view class="form-help">一个大概的时间就够，不需要把周末排满。</view><input class="field-input" placeholder="例如：这个周六下午 14:30" value="{{scheduledAt}}" bindinput="timeInput"/><button class="primary-btn plan-action" loading="{{saving}}" bindtap="arrange">安排这次出发</button></view><view class="form-card"><view class="form-title">现在的状态</view><view class="two-actions"><button class="secondary-btn" data-status="active" bindtap="changeStatus">现在出发</button><button class="secondary-btn" data-status="completed" bindtap="changeStatus">已经完成</button></view></view><view class="form-card"><view class="form-title">同行是可选的</view><view class="form-help">分享的是一个时间明确的计划；开始前，对方可以先看公开主页，再决定是否加入。</view><button class="secondary-btn" bindtap="openInvite">基于这次计划发起同行</button></view><view class="two-actions"><button class="secondary-btn" bindtap="openEdit">编辑我的路线</button><button class="secondary-btn" bindtap="record">写私密记录</button></view><block wx:if="{{editing}}"><view class="modal-mask"/><view class="bottom-sheet"><view class="sheet-handle"/><view class="sheet-title">编辑我的路线</view><label class="field-label">路线名称<input class="field-input" data-field="title" value="{{editForm.title}}" bindinput="editInput"/></label><label class="field-label">路线描述<textarea class="field-textarea short" data-field="description" value="{{editForm.description}}" bindinput="editInput"/></label><label class="field-label">停留点（时间｜名称｜说明，每行一站）<textarea class="field-textarea" data-field="stopsText" value="{{editForm.stopsText}}" bindinput="editInput"/></label><view class="two-actions"><button class="secondary-btn" bindtap="closeEdit">取消</button><button class="primary-btn" bindtap="saveEdit">保存</button></view></view></block><block wx:if="{{showInviteForm}}"><view class="modal-mask"/><view class="bottom-sheet"><view class="sheet-handle"/><view class="sheet-title">发起一次同行</view><label class="field-label">出发时间<input class="field-input" data-field="startTime" value="{{startTime}}" bindinput="inviteInput"/></label><label class="field-label">集合地点<input class="field-input" data-field="meetPlace" value="{{meetPlace}}" bindinput="inviteInput"/></label><label class="field-label">想说的话<textarea class="field-textarea short" data-field="inviteNote" value="{{inviteNote}}" bindinput="inviteInput"/></label><button class="primary-btn" bindtap="submitInvite">发布这次同行</button></view></block></block></view>